00:29:02.083 --> 00:29:04.708
<i>-Absolutely.</i>

00:29:02.083 --> 00:29:04.708
<i>Let me see what I can do.</i>

00:29:02.083 --> 00:29:04.708
-Oh, good.

00:29:04.708 --> 00:29:07.292
Hi. Um, I know this

00:29:04.708 --> 00:29:07.292
