00:29:12.542 --> 00:29:14.750
Uh--

00:29:14.750 --> 00:29:17.292
ANDY: Yeah, any kind of jet.

00:29:17.292 --> 00:29:19.125
-From Miami to New York.

00:29:17.292 --> 00:29:19.125
-Thank you.

00:29:19.125 --> 00:29:21.083
-Yup, I need it tonight.

00:29:19.125 --> 00:29:21.083
I need it--

00:29:19.125 --> 00:29:21.083
-Ow!

00:29:21.083 --> 00:29:23.042
-I thought you were

00:29:21.083 --> 00:29:23.042
going out the other--

00:29:21.083 --> 00:29:23.042
-Sweetie! No.

00:29:23.042 --> 00:29:25.208
-It's over here, honey.

00:29:23.042 --> 00:29:25.208
-Tonight.

00:29:25.208 --> 00:29:27.917
Hi. I'm trying to get

00:29:25.208 --> 00:29:27.917
