00:29:33.375 --> 00:29:35.917
Nothing is flying out?

00:29:33.375 --> 00:29:35.917
What do you mean,

00:29:33.375 --> 00:29:35.917
nothing is flying out?

00:29:35.917 --> 00:29:39.875
It's for Miranda Priestly,

00:29:35.917 --> 00:29:39.875
and I know that she's

00:29:35.917 --> 00:29:39.875
