00:29:39.875 --> 00:29:43.917
Yes. Yes, hi.

00:29:39.875 --> 00:29:43.917
I need a jet tonight

00:29:39.875 --> 00:29:43.917
from Miami to New York.

00:29:43.917 --> 00:29:48.125
-Yeah. Sorry. Hold on.

00:29:43.917 --> 00:29:48.125
-Hello? Miranda, hi.

00:29:48.125 --> 00:29:51.583
I'm trying to get you a flight,

00:29:48.125 --> 00:29:51.583
but no one is flying out

00:29:48.125 --> 00:29:51.583
