00:29:54.750 --> 00:29:57.208
-(thunderclap)

00:29:54.750 --> 00:29:57.208
-Someone must be getting out.

00:29:57.208 --> 00:29:59.333
Call Donatella.

00:29:57.208 --> 00:29:59.333
Get her jet.

00:29:59.333 --> 00:30:01.750
<i>Call everybody else</i>

00:29:59.333 --> 00:30:01.750
<i>that we know that has</i>

00:29:59.333 --> 00:30:01.750
<i>a jet. Irv?</i>

