00:30:13.333 --> 00:30:15.708
Of course not.

00:30:13.333 --> 00:30:15.708
Could I do that?

00:30:15.708 --> 00:30:18.750
Come on. Come on.

00:30:18.750 --> 00:30:22.083
The girls' recital

00:30:18.750 --> 00:30:22.083
was absolutely wonderful.

00:30:22.083 --> 00:30:24.708
They played Rachmaninoff.

00:30:22.083 --> 00:30:24.708
Everyone loved it.

00:30:24.708 --> 00:30:26.875
Everyone except me,

00:30:26.875 --> 00:30:31.000
because, sadly,

00:30:26.875 --> 00:30:31.000
I was not there.

00:30:31.000 --> 00:30:33.542
Miranda,

00:30:31.000 --> 00:30:33.542
I'm so sorry.

00:30:33.542 --> 00:30:35.750
Do you know why

00:30:33.542 --> 00:30:35.750
I hired you?

00:30:35.750 --> 00:30:38.792
I always hire

00:30:35.750 --> 00:30:38.792
the same girl--

00:30:38.792 --> 00:30:42.500
stylish,

00:30:38.792 --> 00:30:42.500
slender, of course,

00:30:42.500 --> 00:30:44.292
