00:30:44.292 --> 00:30:46.375
But so often,

00:30:44.292 --> 00:30:46.375
they turn out to be--

00:30:47.625 --> 00:30:51.000
I don't know--

00:30:47.625 --> 00:30:51.000
disappointing and, um,

00:30:51.000 --> 00:30:52.917
stupid.

00:30:52.917 --> 00:30:58.125
So you, with that

00:30:52.917 --> 00:30:58.125
impressive resume

00:30:58.125 --> 00:31:01.292
and the big speech about

00:30:58.125 --> 00:31:01.292
your so-called work ethic--

00:31:01.292 --> 00:31:04.250
I, um-- I thought you

00:31:01.292 --> 00:31:04.250
would be different.

00:31:04.250 --> 00:31:07.417
I said to myself,

00:31:04.250 --> 00:31:07.417
go ahead.

00:31:08.417 --> 00:31:09.583
Take a chance.

00:31:09.583 --> 00:31:13.250
Hire the smart, fat girl.

00:31:13.250 --> 00:31:16.125
(clears throat)

00:31:13.250 --> 00:31:16.125
I had hope.

00:31:17.250 --> 00:31:20.375
My God. I live on it.

00:31:20.375 --> 00:31:23.500
Anyway, you ended up

00:31:20.375 --> 00:31:23.500
disappointing me

00:31:20.375 --> 00:31:23.500
more than, um--

00:31:25.250 --> 00:31:27.542
more than any

00:31:25.250 --> 00:31:27.542
of the other silly girls.

00:31:29.292 --> 00:31:34.208
Um, I really

00:31:29.292 --> 00:31:34.208
did everything

00:31:29.292 --> 00:31:34.208
I could think of.

00:31:34.208 --> 00:31:36.167
-Uh--

00:31:34.208 --> 00:31:36.167
-That's all.

00:31:45.792 --> 00:31:49.000
Excuse me!

00:31:45.792 --> 00:31:49.000
Where do you think

00:31:45.792 --> 00:31:49.000
