00:32:07.625 --> 00:32:09.458
She hates me, Nigel.

00:32:10.792 --> 00:32:13.208
And that's my problem

00:32:10.792 --> 00:32:13.208
because--

00:32:13.208 --> 00:32:15.500
Oh, wait.

00:32:13.208 --> 00:32:15.500
No, it's not my problem.

00:32:15.500 --> 00:32:19.750
I don't know what else I can do

00:32:15.500 --> 00:32:19.750
because if I do something right,

00:32:15.500 --> 00:32:19.750
it's unacknowledged.

00:32:19.750 --> 00:32:21.917
She doesn't even

00:32:19.750 --> 00:32:21.917
