00:32:27.083 --> 00:32:30.833
-So quit.

00:32:27.083 --> 00:32:30.833
-What?

00:32:30.833 --> 00:32:33.042
-Quit.

00:32:30.833 --> 00:32:33.042
-Quit?

00:32:33.042 --> 00:32:35.583
I can get another girl to take

00:32:33.042 --> 00:32:35.583
