00:32:35.583 --> 00:32:37.833
one who really wants it.

00:32:37.833 --> 00:32:40.417
No, I don't want to quit.

00:32:37.833 --> 00:32:40.417
That's not fair.

00:32:40.417 --> 00:32:44.792
But, you know,

00:32:40.417 --> 00:32:44.792
I'm just saying that I would

00:32:40.417 --> 00:32:44.792
just like a little credit

00:32:44.792 --> 00:32:47.375
for the fact that I'm

00:32:44.792 --> 00:32:47.375
killing myself trying.

00:32:47.375 --> 00:32:49.792
Andy, be serious.

00:32:49.792 --> 00:32:51.708
You are not trying.

00:32:52.500 --> 00:32:55.208
-You are whining.

00:32:52.500 --> 00:32:55.208
