00:33:03.083 --> 00:33:05.625
Hmm? Wake up, six.

00:33:05.625 --> 00:33:08.333
She's just doing her job.

00:33:08.333 --> 00:33:10.542
Don't you know that you

00:33:08.333 --> 00:33:10.542
