00:33:13.125 --> 00:33:16.500
Halston, Lagerfeld,

00:33:13.125 --> 00:33:16.500
de la Renta.

00:33:16.500 --> 00:33:19.958
And what they did,

00:33:16.500 --> 00:33:19.958
what they created,

00:33:19.958 --> 00:33:24.375
was greater than art

00:33:19.958 --> 00:33:24.375
because you live

00:33:19.958 --> 00:33:24.375
your life in it.

00:33:25.917 --> 00:33:29.417
Well, not you, obviously,

00:33:25.917 --> 00:33:29.417
but some people.

00:33:29.417 --> 00:33:32.417
You think this is

00:33:29.417 --> 00:33:32.417
just a magazine, hmm?

00:33:32.417 --> 00:33:34.417
This is not just

00:33:32.417 --> 00:33:34.417
a magazine.

00:33:34.417 --> 00:33:38.833
This is a shining

00:33:34.417 --> 00:33:38.833
beacon of hope for--

00:33:38.833 --> 00:33:41.042
oh, I don't know--

00:33:41.042 --> 00:33:44.167
let's say a young boy

00:33:41.042 --> 00:33:44.167
growing up in Rhode Island

00:33:41.042 --> 00:33:44.167
with six brothers,

00:33:44.167 --> 00:33:46.792
pretending to go to soccer

00:33:44.167 --> 00:33:46.792
practice when he was really

00:33:44.167 --> 00:33:46.792
going to sewing class

00:33:46.792 --> 00:33:50.917
and reading<i> Runway</i>

00:33:46.792 --> 00:33:50.917
under the covers at night

00:33:46.792 --> 00:33:50.917
with a flashlight.

00:33:50.917 --> 00:33:53.167
You have no idea

00:33:50.917 --> 00:33:53.167
how many legends

00:33:50.917 --> 00:33:53.167
have walked these halls.

00:33:53.167 --> 00:33:55.792
And what's worse,

00:33:53.167 --> 00:33:55.792
you don't care.

00:33:55.792 --> 00:33:59.833
Because this place,

00:33:55.792 --> 00:33:59.833
where so many people

00:33:55.792 --> 00:33:59.833
would die to work,

00:33:59.833 --> 00:34:02.958
