00:34:12.792 --> 00:34:14.417
Wake up, sweetheart.

00:34:17.125 --> 00:34:19.292
(sighs)

00:34:21.542 --> 00:34:24.208
-Okay. So I'm screwing it up.

00:34:21.542 --> 00:34:24.208
-Mmm.

00:34:24.208 --> 00:34:26.583
I don't want to.

00:34:26.583 --> 00:34:29.208
I just wish that I knew

00:34:26.583 --> 00:34:29.208
