00:34:34.417 --> 00:34:36.833
-(sighs) Nigel?

00:34:34.417 --> 00:34:36.833
-Hmm?

00:34:36.833 --> 00:34:39.250
Nigel, Nigel.

00:34:40.708 --> 00:34:42.583
No.

00:34:42.583 --> 00:34:45.750
I don't know what

00:34:42.583 --> 00:34:45.750
