00:34:47.583 --> 00:34:49.750
I can guarantee you.

00:34:52.000 --> 00:34:55.625
These are all sample sizes--

00:34:52.000 --> 00:34:55.625
two and four.

00:34:55.625 --> 00:35:00.000
-All right. We're doing

00:34:55.625 --> 00:35:00.000
this for you. And--

00:34:55.625 --> 00:35:00.000
-A poncho?

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:02.625
You'll take what I give you

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:02.625
