00:35:02.625 --> 00:35:05.500
-We're doing this Dolce

00:35:02.625 --> 00:35:05.500
for you.

00:35:02.625 --> 00:35:05.500
-Hmm!

00:35:05.500 --> 00:35:08.083
And shoes.

00:35:08.083 --> 00:35:11.917
-Jimmy Choo's.

00:35:08.083 --> 00:35:11.917
-Hmm.

00:35:11.917 --> 00:35:15.000
-Manolo Blahnik.

00:35:11.917 --> 00:35:15.000
-Wow.

00:35:15.000 --> 00:35:17.750
Nancy Gonzalez.

00:35:15.000 --> 00:35:17.750
Love that.

00:35:17.750 --> 00:35:19.792
Okay, Narciso Rodriguez.

00:35:17.750 --> 00:35:19.792
This we love.

00:35:19.792 --> 00:35:24.000
-Uh, it might fit.

00:35:19.792 --> 00:35:24.000
It might.

00:35:19.792 --> 00:35:24.000
-What?

00:35:24.000 --> 00:35:28.042
Okay. Now, Chanel. You're

00:35:24.000 --> 00:35:28.042
in desperate need of Chanel.

00:35:24.000 --> 00:35:28.042
Darling, shall we?

00:35:28.042 --> 00:35:32.083
We have to get to the

00:35:28.042 --> 00:35:32.083
beauty department, and God knows

00:35:28.042 --> 00:35:32.083
how long that's going to take.

00:35:32.083 --> 00:35:33.458
(groans)

00:35:33.458 --> 00:35:36.208
I mean, I have no idea

00:35:33.458 --> 00:35:36.208
why Miranda hired her.

00:35:36.208 --> 00:35:39.708
Me neither.

00:35:36.208 --> 00:35:39.708
The other day, we were

00:35:36.208 --> 00:35:39.708
