like that down

01:27:22.083 --> 01:27:25.792
and then file it away

01:27:22.083 --> 01:27:25.792
to use on us girls?

01:27:25.792 --> 01:27:29.000
-I'm Christian Thompson.

01:27:25.792 --> 01:27:29.000
That's my way.

01:27:25.792 --> 01:27:29.000
-That's your way. Right.

01:27:29.000 --> 01:27:32.375
I work freelance.

01:27:29.000 --> 01:27:32.375
I have a lot of free time

01:27:29.000 --> 01:27:32.375
on my hands.

01:27:33.917 --> 01:27:36.708
You know,

01:27:33.917 --> 01:27:36.708
I never understood

01:27:36.708 --> 01:27:39.708
why everyone

01:27:36.708 --> 01:27:39.708
was so crazy about Paris,

01:27:39.708 --> 01:27:44.583
but... it is so beautiful.

01:27:44.583 --> 01:27:47.208
(giggles)

01:27:47.208 --> 01:27:51.667
Mm. I-I can't.

01:27:47.208 --> 01:27:51.667
I'm sorry.

01:27:51.667 --> 01:27:56.458
I can't. You know,

01:27:51.667 --> 01:27:56.458
Nate and I just split up

01:27:51.667 --> 01:27:56.458
a couple days ago, and I can't.

01:27:59.583 --> 01:28:02.208
Ooh.

01:27:59.583 --> 01:28:02.208
I've had too much wine.

01:28:02.208 --> 01:28:05.750
And my hearing-- vision--

01:28:02.208 --> 01:28:05.750
judgment's impaired.

01:28:09.542 --> 01:28:12.542
No, I barely know you.

01:28:09.542 --> 01:28:12.542
I'm in a strange city.

01:28:14.542 --> 01:28:18.750
I... am out of excuses.

01:28:18.750 --> 01:28:20.375
Thank God.

01:28:48.833 --> 01:28:50.833
(groans)

01:29:01.625 --> 01:29:03.000
(gasps)

01:29:08.792 --> 01:29:10.667
Yes.

01:29:14.167 --> 01:29:15.708
Oh, shoot.

01:29:21.750 --> 01:29:24.417
(door opens)

01:29:24.417 --> 01:29:26.750
<i>Bonjour, madame.</i>

01:29:26.750 --> 01:29:29.292
Uh, what the hell is this?

01:29:29.292 --> 01:29:32.625
What does it look like?

01:29:29.292 --> 01:29:32.625
It's a mock-up.

01:29:32.625 --> 01:29:34.875
Yeah. Of?

01:29:34.875 --> 01:29:36.625
Of what<i> American Runway</i>

01:29:34.875 --> 01:29:36.625
will look like

01:29:36.625 --> 01:29:40.208
when Jacqueline Follet

01:29:36.625 --> 01:29:40.208
is the new editor in chief.

01:29:40.208 --> 01:29:43.333
Wh-- They're replacing Miranda?

01:29:43.333 --> 01:29:47.458
Yeah. And she's

01:29:43.333 --> 01:29:47.458
bringing me in to run

01:29:43.333 --> 01:29:47.458
all the editorial content.

01:29:49.500 --> 01:29:51.792
You're really surprised?

01:29:51.792 --> 01:29:55.583
Jacqueline's a lot younger

01:29:51.792 --> 01:29:55.583
than Miranda. She has

01:29:51.792 --> 01:29:55.583
a fresher take on things.

01:29:55.583 --> 01:30:01.000
Not to mention<i> American Runway's</i>

01:29:55.583 --> 01:30:01.000
one of the most expensive books

01:29:55.583 --> 01:30:01.000
in the business.

01:30:01.000 --> 01:30:05.292
Jacqueline does the same thing

01:30:01.000 --> 01:30:05.292
for a lot less money.

01:30:05.292 --> 01:30:09.000
And Irv--

01:30:05.292 --> 01:30:09.000
Irv's a businessman, you know.

01:30:09.000 --> 01:30:13.417
Miranda will be devastated.

01:30:09.000 --> 01:30:13.417
Her whole life is about<i> Runway.</i>

01:30:09.000 --> 01:30:13.417
He can't do that to her.

01:30:13.417 --> 01:30:17.000
It's done.

01:30:13.417 --> 01:30:17.000
Irv's gonna tell Miranda

01:30:13.417 --> 01:30:17.000
after the party for James.

01:30:17.000 --> 01:30:18.917
And she has no idea?

01:30:18.917 --> 01:30:21.250
She's a big girl.

01:30:18.917 --> 01:30:21.250
She'll be fine.

01:30:22.625 --> 01:30:25.833
Shi--

01:30:22.625 --> 01:30:25.833
I have to go.

01:30:25.833 --> 01:30:27.458
Andy.

01:30:27.458 --> 01:30:29.333
Andy, it's done.

01:30:31.333 --> 01:30:32.917
Baby, it's done.

01:30:34.167 --> 01:30:36.000
I'm not your baby.

01:30:44.667 --> 01:30:47.167
-(phone ringing)

01:30:44.667 --> 01:30:47.167
-Allo.

01:30:47.167 --> 01:30:49.542
Oh! Oh!

01:30:47.167 --> 01:30:49.542
Thank God you're there.

01:30:49.542 --> 01:30:52.250
-(sighs) Excuse me?

01:30:49.542 --> 01:30:52.250
<i>-I need to talk to you</i>

01:30:49.542 --> 01:30:52.250
<i>right away.</i>

01:30:52.250 --> 01:30:54.625
<i>It's about</i>

01:30:52.250 --> 01:30:54.625
<i>Jacqueline Follet.</i>

01:30:54.625 --> 01:30:59.167
Shit! Oh, shit!

01:30:54.625 --> 01:30:59.167
Shit, shit, shit!

01:31:15.583 --> 01:31:19.458
-Yes.

01:31:15.583 --> 01:31:19.458
-Mr. Ravitz, I'm so sorry

01:31:15.583 --> 01:31:19.458
to bother you. I was wondering--

01:31:19.458 --> 01:31:22.208
Have you completely

01:31:19.458 --> 01:31:22.208
lost your mind?

01:31:22.208 --> 01:31:26.458
-I need to talk to you.

01:31:22.208 --> 01:31:26.458
-Do not disturb me again.

01:31:26.458 --> 01:31:30.083
But, um,

01:31:26.458 --> 01:31:30.083
it's just for one--

01:31:26.458 --> 01:31:30.083
Miranda!

01:31:34.875 --> 01:31:36.833
(horn honks)

01:31:47.708 --> 01:31:51.750
Miranda. Miranda.

01:31:47.708 --> 01:31:51.750
Wait, I need to talk to you.

01:31:51.750 --> 01:31:54.125
Irv is making Jacqueline Follet

01:31:51.750 --> 01:31:54.125
the editor in chief of<i> Runway.</i>

01:31:54.125 --> 01:31:56.750
Christian Thompson told me

01:31:54.125 --> 01:31:56.750
he's gonna work for her.

01:31:56.750 --> 01:31:59.958
Irv is going to tell you today.

01:31:56.750 --> 01:31:59.958
I thought maybe if I told you,

01:31:56.750 --> 01:31:59.958
that you could fix it.

01:31:59.958 --> 01:32:01.917
Do I smell freesias?

01:32:01.917 --> 01:32:06.250
What? No.

01:32:01.917 --> 01:32:06.250
I-I specifically told them--

01:32:06.250 --> 01:32:10.875
If I see freesias anywhere,

01:32:10.875 --> 01:32:14.083
I will be very disappointed.

01:32:14.083 --> 01:32:18.750
For 72 years,<i> Runway</i>

01:32:14.083 --> 01:32:18.750
has been more than a magazine.

01:32:18.750 --> 01:32:22.292
It has been a beacon

01:32:18.750 --> 01:32:22.292
of elegance and grace.

01:32:22.292 --> 01:32:27.750
Miranda Priestly is

01:32:22.292 --> 01:32:27.750
the finest possible guardian

01:32:22.292 --> 01:32:27.750
of that beacon,

01:32:27.750 --> 01:32:33.292
setting a standard

01:32:27.750 --> 01:32:33.292
that inspires people

01:32:27.750 --> 01:32:33.292
across the globe.

01:32:33.292 --> 01:32:37.708
Ladies and gentlemen,

01:32:33.292 --> 01:32:37.708
I give you Miranda Priestly.

01:32:55.000 --> 01:32:57.542
Thank you,

01:32:55.000 --> 01:32:57.542
my dear friend.

01:32:58.625 --> 01:33:01.625
Bonjour.

01:32:58.625 --> 01:33:01.625
(chuckles)

01:33:01.625 --> 01:33:04.875
Thank you very much

01:33:01.625 --> 01:33:04.875
for coming today

01:33:04.875 --> 01:33:09.792
to help celebrate

01:33:04.875 --> 01:33:09.792
our dear friend, James Holt.

01:33:17.083 --> 01:33:21.042
But before I talk

01:33:17.083 --> 01:33:21.042
to you about James

01:33:21.042 --> 01:33:24.542
and his many

01:33:21.042 --> 01:33:24.542
accomplishments,

01:33:24.542 --> 01:33:28.917
I would like first

01:33:24.542 --> 01:33:28.917
to share some news with you.

01:33:30.042 --> 01:33:33.458
Um, as many of you know,

01:33:33.458 --> 01:33:36.542
uh, recently

01:33:33.458 --> 01:33:36.542
Massimo Corteleoni

01:33:36.542 --> 01:33:40.750
has agreed

01:33:36.542 --> 01:33:40.750
to finance the expansion

01:33:36.542 --> 01:33:40.750
of the James Holt label,

01:33:40.750 --> 01:33:44.792
transforming the work

01:33:40.750 --> 01:33:44.792
of this visionary artist

01:33:44.792 --> 01:33:49.167
into a global brand,

01:33:44.792 --> 01:33:49.167
which is really

01:33:44.792 --> 01:33:49.167
an exciting enterprise.

01:33:49.167 --> 01:33:52.792
<i>Runway </i>and James Holt

01:33:49.167 --> 01:33:52.792
share many things in common,

01:33:52.792 --> 01:33:57.750
chief among them,

01:33:52.792 --> 01:33:57.750
a commitment to excellence.

01:33:57.750 --> 01:34:01.917
And so, it should come

01:33:57.750 --> 01:34:01.917
as no surprise

01:34:01.917 --> 01:34:03.917
that when the time came

01:34:01.917 --> 01:34:03.917
for James to choose

01:34:03.917 --> 01:34:06.333
the new president

01:34:03.917 --> 01:34:06.333
of James Holt International,

01:34:06.333 --> 01:34:10.417
he chose from within

01:34:06.333 --> 01:34:10.417
the<i> Runway </i>family.

01:34:10.417 --> 01:34:14.542
And it's

01:34:10.417 --> 01:34:14.542
my great happiness today

01:34:14.542 --> 01:34:18.250
to announce to you all

01:34:14.542 --> 01:34:18.250
that that person

01:34:18.250 --> 01:34:23.583
is my friend and

01:34:18.250 --> 01:34:23.583
longtime esteemed colleague,

01:34:23.583 --> 01:34:26.083
Jacqueline Follet.

01:34:38.292 --> 01:34:40.875
Thank you.<i> Merci.</i>

01:34:57.083 --> 01:34:59.958
And now to the main event,

01:34:59.958 --> 01:35:03.208
our celebration of James Holt.

01:35:03.208 --> 01:35:06.542
We at<i> Runway </i>are very proud

01:35:03.208 --> 01:35:06.542
to have been--

01:35:07.833 --> 01:35:10.250
When the time is right,

01:35:07.833 --> 01:35:10.250
she'll pay me back.

01:35:13.125 --> 01:35:14.875
You sure about that?

01:35:15.708 --> 01:35:18.000
No.

01:35:18.000 --> 01:35:20.125
But I hope

01:35:18.000 --> 01:35:20.125
for the best.

01:35:21.125 --> 01:35:22.667
I have to.

01:35:23.875 --> 01:35:26.708
(people clamoring)

01:35:42.958 --> 01:35:44.792
You thought I didn't know.

01:35:47.208 --> 01:35:51.125
I've known what was happening

01:35:47.208 --> 01:35:51.125
for quite some time.

01:35:52.167 --> 01:35:53.917
<i>It just took me a little while</i>

01:35:53.917 --> 01:35:56.583
<i>to find a suitable alternative</i>

01:35:53.917 --> 01:35:56.583
<i>for Jacqueline.</i>

01:35:56.583 --> 01:36:01.958
And that James Holt job

01:35:56.583 --> 01:36:01.958
was so absurdly overpaid

01:36:01.958 --> 01:36:04.583
that, of course, she

01:36:01.958 --> 01:36:04.583
jumped at it. (chuckles)

01:36:04.583 --> 01:36:09.042
<i>So I just had to tell</i>

01:36:04.583 --> 01:36:09.042
<i>Irv that Jacqueline</i>

01:36:04.583 --> 01:36:09.042
<i>was unavailable.</i>

01:36:09.042 --> 01:36:13.667
The truth is, there is no one

01:36:09.042 --> 01:36:13.667
that can do what I do,

01:36:13.667 --> 01:36:15.292
including her.

01:36:16.583 --> 01:36:18.125
Any of the other choices

01:36:18.125 --> 01:36:20.333
would have found

01:36:18.125 --> 01:36:20.333
that job impossible,

01:36:20.333 --> 01:36:22.167
and the magazine

01:36:20.333 --> 01:36:22.167
would have suffered.

01:36:22.167 --> 01:36:25.958
(sighs)

01:36:22.167 --> 01:36:25.958
Especially because of the list.

01:36:27.375 --> 01:36:31.083
The list of designers,

01:36:27.375 --> 01:36:31.083
photographers,

01:36:31.083 --> 01:36:35.083
<i>editors, writers, models,</i>

01:36:31.083 --> 01:36:35.083
<i>all of whom were found by me,</i>

01:36:31.083 --> 01:36:35.083
<i>nurtured by me</i>

01:36:35.083 --> 01:36:37.833
and have promised me

01:36:35.083 --> 01:36:37.833
they will follow me

01:36:37.833 --> 01:36:41.458
whenever and if ever

01:36:37.833 --> 01:36:41.458
I choose to leave<i> Runway.</i>

01:36:41.458 --> 01:36:43.333
(chuckles)

01:36:43.333 --> 01:36:45.833
<i>So he reconsidered.</i>

01:36:49.083 --> 01:36:52.333
But I was very,

01:36:49.083 --> 01:36:52.333
very impressed

01:36:52.333 --> 01:36:55.417
by how intently

01:36:52.333 --> 01:36:55.417
you tried to warn me.

01:36:55.417 --> 01:36:58.667
I never thought

01:36:55.417 --> 01:36:58.667
I would say this, Andrea,

01:36:58.667 --> 01:37:00.500
but I really--

01:37:02.333 --> 01:37:05.167
I see a great deal

01:37:02.333 --> 01:37:05.167
of myself in you.

01:37:08.250 --> 01:37:12.375
You can see beyond

01:37:08.250 --> 01:37:12.375
what people want

01:37:08.250 --> 01:37:12.375
and what they need,

01:37:12.375 --> 01:37:14.917
and you can choose

01:37:12.375 --> 01:37:14.917
for yourself.

01:37:18.458 --> 01:37:20.917
I don't think

01:37:18.458 --> 01:37:20.917
I'm like that.

01:37:22.042 --> 01:37:23.792
I--

01:37:27.250 --> 01:37:29.375
I couldn't do

01:37:27.250 --> 01:37:29.375
what you did to Nigel,

01:37:27.250 --> 01:37:29.375
Miranda.

01:37:29.375 --> 01:37:31.083
I couldn't do

01:37:29.375 --> 01:37:31.083
something like that.

01:37:32.208 --> 01:37:36.000
Mm. You already did.

01:37:40.042 --> 01:37:41.583
To Emily.

01:37:41.583 --> 01:37:43.542
That's not what I--

01:37:45.333 --> 01:37:47.875
No, that was--

01:37:45.333 --> 01:37:47.875
that was different.

01:37:45.333 --> 01:37:47.875
I didn't have a choice.

01:37:47.875 --> 01:37:51.667
Oh, no, you chose.

01:37:47.875 --> 01:37:51.667
You chose to get ahead.

01:37:53.042 --> 01:37:56.167
You want this life,

01:37:53.042 --> 01:37:56.167
those choices are necessary.

01:37:56.167 --> 01:38:00.875
But what if...

01:37:56.167 --> 01:38:00.875
this isn't what I want?

01:38:00.875 --> 01:38:04.875
I mean, what if I don't

01:38:00.875 --> 01:38:04.875
want to live the way you live?

01:38:04.875 --> 01:38:08.792
Don't be ridiculous, Andrea.

01:38:04.875 --> 01:38:08.792
Everybody wants this.

01:38:10.333 --> 01:38:13.208
Everybody wants to be us.

01:38:19.625 --> 01:38:22.292
(reporters clamoring)

01:38:22.292 --> 01:38:25.042
(mid-tempo music playing)

01:39:03.042 --> 01:39:05.083
(cell phone ringing)

01:39:39.750 --> 01:39:42.167
I have to be

01:39:39.750 --> 01:39:42.167
at work in 20 minutes.

01:39:43.542 --> 01:39:45.500
What's up?

01:39:46.875 --> 01:39:50.333
Well, I just--

01:39:50.333 --> 01:39:53.208
I wanted to say

01:39:50.333 --> 01:39:53.208
that you were right

01:39:50.333 --> 01:39:53.208
about everything.

01:39:54.167 --> 01:39:56.458
That...

01:39:56.458 --> 01:39:59.167
I turned my back on my friends

01:39:56.458 --> 01:39:59.167
and my family

01:39:59.167 --> 01:40:01.250
and everything

01:39:59.167 --> 01:40:01.250
I believed in,

01:40:01.250 --> 01:40:04.333
and-- and for what?

01:40:04.333 --> 01:40:09.542
For shoes and shirts

01:40:04.333 --> 01:40:09.542
and jackets and belts.

01:40:09.542 --> 01:40:11.583
Nate.

01:40:14.792 --> 01:40:17.208
I'm sorry.

01:40:24.708 --> 01:40:27.250
I--

01:40:24.708 --> 01:40:27.250
(clears throat)

01:40:27.250 --> 01:40:30.750
I flew up to Boston

01:40:27.250 --> 01:40:30.750
while you were gone.

01:40:30.750 --> 01:40:32.542
I interviewed

01:40:30.750 --> 01:40:32.542
at the Oak Room.

01:40:33.417 --> 01:40:35.958
And?

01:40:35.958 --> 01:40:38.875
And you're looking

01:40:35.958 --> 01:40:38.875
at their new sous-chef.

01:40:38.875 --> 01:40:43.083
-I'm moving up there

01:40:38.875 --> 01:40:43.083
in a couple weeks.

01:40:38.875 --> 01:40:43.083
-That's great. Congratulations.

01:40:48.167 --> 01:40:51.583
I don't know what I'm gonna

01:40:48.167 --> 01:40:51.583
do without those late-night

01:40:48.167 --> 01:40:51.583
grilled cheeses, but--

01:40:51.583 --> 01:40:55.958
I'm pretty sure

01:40:51.583 --> 01:40:55.958
they have bread in Boston.

01:40:55.958 --> 01:40:58.125
May even have Jarlsberg.

01:41:01.250 --> 01:41:03.958
We might be able

01:41:01.250 --> 01:41:03.958
to figure something out.

01:41:05.542 --> 01:41:07.833
You think?

01:41:07.833 --> 01:41:09.708
Yeah.

01:41:16.542 --> 01:41:20.292
So, what about you?

01:41:16.542 --> 01:41:20.292
I mean, what are you

01:41:16.542 --> 01:41:20.292
gonna do now?

01:41:20.292 --> 01:41:23.500
Actually, I, uh-- I have

01:41:20.292 --> 01:41:23.500
a job interview today.

01:41:23.500 --> 01:41:26.042
-Oh, yeah?

01:41:23.500 --> 01:41:26.042
-Mm-hm.

01:41:26.042 --> 01:41:28.333
That's what

01:41:26.042 --> 01:41:28.333
you're wearing?

01:41:28.333 --> 01:41:30.542
Shut up.

01:41:28.333 --> 01:41:30.542
I like this.

01:41:35.292 --> 01:41:37.417
-Andy, Greg Hill.

01:41:35.292 --> 01:41:37.417
-Hello.

01:41:37.417 --> 01:41:40.167
Come on.

01:41:37.417 --> 01:41:40.167
These clips are excellent.

01:41:40.167 --> 01:41:43.125
This thing

01:41:40.167 --> 01:41:43.125
on the Janitors' Union,

01:41:40.167 --> 01:41:43.125
that's exactly what we do here.

01:41:43.125 --> 01:41:46.083
My only question is,<i> Runway?</i>

01:41:46.083 --> 01:41:48.875
You were there

01:41:46.083 --> 01:41:48.875
for less than a year.

01:41:48.875 --> 01:41:51.333
What the hell

01:41:48.875 --> 01:41:51.333
kind of a blip is that?

01:41:52.125 --> 01:41:54.250
Learned a lot.

01:41:56.083 --> 01:42:00.875
In the end, though,

01:41:56.083 --> 01:42:00.875
I kind of screwed it up.

01:42:00.875 --> 01:42:04.458
I called over there

01:42:00.875 --> 01:42:04.458
for a reference, left word

01:42:00.875 --> 01:42:04.458
with some snooty girl.

01:42:04.458 --> 01:42:08.375
Next thing you know,

01:42:04.458 --> 01:42:08.375
I got a fax from

01:42:04.458 --> 01:42:08.375
Miranda Priestly herself,

01:42:08.375 --> 01:42:10.917
saying that

01:42:08.375 --> 01:42:10.917
of all the assistants

01:42:08.375 --> 01:42:10.917
she's ever had,

01:42:10.917 --> 01:42:13.417
you were, by far,

01:42:10.917 --> 01:42:13.417
her biggest disappointment.

01:42:13.417 --> 01:42:17.125
And, if I don't hire you,

01:42:17.125 --> 01:42:18.875
I am an idiot.

01:42:20.833 --> 01:42:22.958
You must have done

01:42:20.833 --> 01:42:22.958
something right.

01:42:51.458 --> 01:42:55.000
-(beeping)

01:42:51.458 --> 01:42:55.000
-(phone ringing)

01:42:55.958 --> 01:42:57.792
Miranda Priestly's office.

01:42:57.792 --> 01:42:59.417
Hey, Emily, it's Andy.

01:42:59.417 --> 01:43:02.958
<i>Don't hang up.</i>

01:42:59.417 --> 01:43:02.958
<i>I have a favor to ask you.</i>

01:43:02.958 --> 01:43:05.083
You have a favor

01:43:02.958 --> 01:43:05.083
to ask of me?

01:43:05.083 --> 01:43:09.000
Yeah. The thing is, I have

01:43:05.083 --> 01:43:09.000
all these clothes from Paris,

01:43:09.000 --> 01:43:11.292
and I don't have anyplace

01:43:09.000 --> 01:43:11.292
to wear them,

01:43:11.292 --> 01:43:15.542
so I was wondering

01:43:11.292 --> 01:43:15.542
if you could take them

01:43:11.292 --> 01:43:15.542
off my hands.

01:43:19.875 --> 01:43:23.583
Well, I don't know.

01:43:19.875 --> 01:43:23.583
It's a huge imposition.

01:43:23.583 --> 01:43:28.250
And I'll have to

01:43:23.583 --> 01:43:28.250
get them taken in.

01:43:23.583 --> 01:43:28.250
I mean, they'll drown me.

01:43:28.250 --> 01:43:32.875
But I suppose I could

01:43:28.250 --> 01:43:32.875
help you out. I will have Roy

01:43:28.250 --> 01:43:32.875
pick them up this afternoon.

01:43:32.875 --> 01:43:37.833
Thanks, Em.

01:43:32.875 --> 01:43:37.833
I appreciate it.

01:43:32.875 --> 01:43:37.833
Good luck.

01:43:47.167 --> 01:43:50.583
You have some very

01:43:47.167 --> 01:43:50.583
large shoes to fill.

01:43:50.583 --> 01:43:52.917
I hope you know that.

01:43:59.333 --> 01:44:02.667
I don't understand

01:43:59.333 --> 01:44:02.667
why it is so challenging...

01:44:02.667 --> 01:44:06.292
to get my car

01:44:02.667 --> 01:44:06.292
when I ask for it.

01:44:47.417 --> 01:44:49.542
(chuckles)

01:44:51.750 --> 01:44:53.292
Go.

01:49:18.500 --> 01:49:20.875
Captioned by:

01:49:18.500 --> 01:49:20.875
Axium Digital, Inc.